00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,120
Did you know?

551
00:32:26,120 --> 00:32:27,400
High-altitude lakes
like those in Qinghai

552
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:28,360
are all saltwater lakes.

553
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:30,240
Because the water gets trapped.

554
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,240
Water flows in but doesn't flow out.

555
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:33,480
Water slowly evaporates

556
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:34,480
and with little rain,

557
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:35,640
the place will turn
into a saltwater lake.

558
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:37,080
But this is the outlet.

559
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:38,360
The water keeps flowing.

560
00:32:38,360 --> 00:32:39,560
So the mineral deposits

561
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:40,800
keep building up

562
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:41,800
and turn this
into a freshwater lake.

563
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,840
It's so beautiful.

564
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:47,240
♪Heaven on earth♪

565
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:22,480
You couldn't bring
the big stools up, huh?

566
00:33:22,980 --> 00:33:23,880
(Camping stools)

567
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:24,440
Little stools.

568
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,560
All we have left are tiny stools.

569
00:33:25,560 --> 00:33:26,240
Little stools.

570
00:33:29,600 --> 00:33:31,360
The way you reach out makes me nervous.

571
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:33,360
Sit.

572
00:33:34,560 --> 00:33:36,000
It's a little too crowded here.

573
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:36,840
It feels a little tight.

574
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:39,920
(Loving family of eight)
And the air's already thin.

575
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,720
Everyone around me is sucking it all up.

576
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:44,320
You two broad-shouldered guys
are beside me.

577
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:45,080
I'm here with my sloping ones.

578
00:33:46,760 --> 00:33:48,440
Next, we're going to do a mission.

579
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,280
It's called

580
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:50,360
Clueless Killer.

581
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:51,800
(Clueless Killer)
Among the eight players,

582
00:33:51,800 --> 00:33:53,240
(Six Good Guys, one Boss, one Killer)
we have six Good Guys,

583
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:54,600
one Boss,

584
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:55,760
and one Killer.

585
00:33:55,760 --> 00:33:57,960
The Boss and Killer
must identify each other

586
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:58,920
using a secret signal.

587
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:00,880
(Boss must pass the target on secretly)
The Boss has a target

588
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:02,480
(Killer identifies and kills target)
and must tell Killer secretly.

589
00:34:02,840 --> 00:34:04,240
The Killer identifies the target

590
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:05,440
to eliminate them.

591
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,400
To eliminate someone,

592
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,480
the Killer must shout at their target,

593
00:34:07,480 --> 00:34:08,400
"Name,"

594
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:09,040
"you're out!"

595
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:11,080
(Killer's attack:)
If Killer says it wrongly,

596
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:12,240
(shout "Name, you're out!" at target)
the kill doesn't count.

597
00:34:12,720 --> 00:34:13,520
No one's ever shouted that

598
00:34:13,520 --> 00:34:14,400
at Five Flower Lake, right?

599
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:15,400
No one's ever taken a life

600
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,360
at Five Flower Lake, right?

601
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,200
Let's add a splash of red.

602
00:34:18,200 --> 00:34:18,920
Six Flower Lake.

603
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:20,960
The Killer has four bullets.

604
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:23,360
Before the Good Guys
finish the corn-picking task,

605
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,000
(Killer shoots three targets to win)
the Boss and Killer

606
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:27,480
must hit three targets to win.

607
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,360
Otherwise, the Good Guys win.

608
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:31,200
If the Good Guys vote out the Boss,

609
00:34:31,200 --> 00:34:32,120
they win too.

610
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:34,840
So just don't let them
recognize each other.

611
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:36,200
Right.

612
00:34:36,200 --> 00:34:37,640
There's work?

613
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:39,880
So while he's working?

614
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:41,040
We all have work to do.

615
00:34:41,040 --> 00:34:42,160
Yeah. We're all working.

616
00:34:42,160 --> 00:34:44,160
Once you finish your assigned task,

617
00:34:44,160 --> 00:34:45,320
one of the Killer's bullets

618
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,240
will be forfeited.

619
00:34:46,240 --> 00:34:47,240
They lose one bullet.

620
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,560
So we better work fast.

621
00:34:48,560 --> 00:34:49,440
Yes.

622
00:34:50,240 --> 00:34:51,320
Did you change into your swim trunks?

623
00:34:52,080 --> 00:34:52,720
Swim trunks?

624
00:34:53,160 --> 00:34:55,040
Your job is to get in there
and spear a fish.

625
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:56,040
You're going in the water.

626
00:34:56,040 --> 00:34:56,960
(Bandwagoning instantly)
Don't you know?

627
00:34:56,960 --> 00:34:58,360
You can't be serious.

628
00:34:58,360 --> 00:34:59,300
(Yeah, right!)

629
00:34:59,380 --> 00:35:01,360
(Getting in the water is dangerous)
This water's worth more than I am.

630
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:02,240
(Damaging Jiuzhaigou's
irreplaceable travertine landscape)

631
00:35:02,240 --> 00:35:03,780
(is illegal)
They won't let me in there.

632
00:35:06,240 --> 00:35:07,440
I've got a question.

633
00:35:07,640 --> 00:35:09,800
When you're handing out the role cards,

634
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:12,000
