what's written on the civilian card?

635
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:12,400
How about this?

636
00:35:12,680 --> 00:35:14,480
Let's play a practice round first.

637
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:15,080
Sure.

638
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:16,040
(Drawing roles)

639
00:35:16,040 --> 00:35:16,600
Hand out the cards.

640
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:24,880
Three, two, one. Sneak a peek.

641
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:35,000
What're you doing?

642
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:36,840
They said to sneak a peek.

643
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:37,840
Sneak...

644
00:35:37,860 --> 00:35:39,640
(Laughing in disbelief)
Look at your own card.

645
00:35:39,640 --> 00:35:41,320
Why are you peeking at mine?

646
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:43,680
My bad.

647
00:35:43,680 --> 00:35:44,380
A mistake.

648
00:35:44,380 --> 00:35:46,020
(Gosh)

649
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:52,560
Is it a lot of words, Teng?

650
00:35:55,520 --> 00:35:57,120
Is the Five Flower Lake in there?

651
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:59,680
I'm a civilian at Five Flower Lake.

652
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:01,280
Everyone, close your eyes.

653
00:36:03,580 --> 00:36:05,940
(Clueless Killer: Practice round)

654
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:08,800
Killer, open your eyes.

655
00:36:11,380 --> 00:36:14,260
(This round's Killer: Fan Chengcheng)
Please check your secret signal.

656
00:36:14,260 --> 00:36:17,740
(Secret Signal: Wiping away tears)

657
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:20,840
Now, the Boss with assigned target,

658
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:21,240
open your eyes.

659
00:36:22,020 --> 00:36:25,470
(This round's Boss: Jia Bing)
Please check your secret signal

660
00:36:25,470 --> 00:36:27,731
(Secret signal: Wiping away tears)
and first target.

661
00:36:27,731 --> 00:36:29,460
(Target: Bai Jingting)
and first target.

662
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:30,920
(Secret signal: Wiping away tears)
Everyone, open your eyes.

663
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,840
(Boss: Jia Bing, Killer: Fan Chengcheng,
Target: Bai Jingting)

664
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,840
Can the person who gets to shoot

665
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:34,480
