698
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:18,320
Don't let the corn fall to the ground.

699
00:38:18,360 --> 00:38:20,280
You're doing worse than me.

700
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:21,000
I haven't shucked even one.

701
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:22,200
(Doing the secret signal)

702
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:23,280
My eyes are so dry.

703
00:38:23,340 --> 00:38:24,080
(Used the signal keyword)

704
00:38:24,080 --> 00:38:24,680
Who did that?

705
00:38:24,680 --> 00:38:25,340
You okay?

706
00:38:25,340 --> 00:38:26,380
