709
00:38:33,340 --> 00:38:35,180
(Waiting for the right moment)

710
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:36,520
My eyes.

711
00:38:36,520 --> 00:38:37,720
My eyes are bothering me.

712
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:41,200
My eyes are bothering me too.

713
00:38:41,300 --> 00:38:42,140
Oh my.

714
00:38:42,620 --> 00:38:44,580
