764
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:18,400
Shen Teng, you're out!

765
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:21,640
I figured you wanted to leave.

766
00:41:23,080 --> 00:41:24,680
You missed the second bullet too.

767
00:41:24,680 --> 00:41:25,440
Game over.

768
00:41:29,060 --> 00:41:30,740
