00:43:33,380 --> 00:43:35,180
(Boss: Bai Jingting, Killer:
Hu Xianxu, Target: Wang Churan)

823
00:43:35,180 --> 00:43:36,160
(Secret signal: Pull up your pant leg)

824
00:43:36,160 --> 00:43:37,400
Everyone's grabbing corn on their own.

825
00:43:38,260 --> 00:43:40,820
(Boss Bai gets straight to work)

826
00:43:40,860 --> 00:43:43,540
(Killer Hu watches every pant leg)

827
00:43:43,580 --> 00:43:46,020
(Eyes on the pant legs)

828
00:43:47,020 --> 00:43:49,540
(Looking for his partner)

829
00:43:53,960 --> 00:43:55,040
After all that work,

830
00:43:55,040 --> 00:43:56,360
not a single kernel came off!

831
00:43:56,380 --> 00:43:57,880
(All action, no progress)

832
00:43:57,880 --> 00:43:59,440
Bai makes the biggest fuss

833
00:43:59,440 --> 00:44:00,320
but shells the least corn.

834
00:44:00,380 --> 00:44:02,180
(It's all an act)

835
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:11,520
It's raining.

836
00:44:13,820 --> 00:44:15,020
(So incredibly casual)

837
00:44:15,100 --> 00:44:17,260
(Giving the secret signal)

838
00:44:18,540 --> 00:44:21,180
(Caught it instantly)

839
00:44:21,560 --> 00:44:23,040
I'm the killer with the gun.

840
00:44:23,520 --> 00:44:26,360
(Killer reveals himself)
I've already found my partner.

841
00:44:28,900 --> 00:44:30,220
(That was slick)

842
00:44:30,260 --> 00:44:31,340
(Is it you?)

843
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:31,960
It's me.

844
00:44:33,840 --> 00:44:35,360
Boss, just give me the order, okay?

845
00:44:36,080 --> 00:44:37,120
Just watch me take him out.

846
00:44:37,460 --> 00:44:39,080
(Fooled absolutely no one)

847
00:44:39,080 --> 00:44:39,840
Locked and loaded.

848
00:44:40,440 --> 00:44:41,560
Ready to fire.

849
00:44:45,060 --> 00:44:48,380
(Killer and boss have connected)

850
00:44:48,420 --> 00:44:50,780
(Secretly dropping hints)

851
00:44:52,220 --> 00:44:54,460
(Hints are in place)

852
00:44:54,500 --> 00:44:58,380
(Do it, Hu!)

853
00:44:58,420 --> 00:45:00,460
(Connection failed)

854
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:02,320
Since you saw it...

855
00:45:02,320 --> 00:45:03,800
Anyu, just tell me who to kill.

856
00:45:03,820 --> 00:45:04,980
(Bai, you can tell me now)

857
00:45:08,200 --> 00:45:09,320
Still don't get it?

858
00:45:09,340 --> 00:45:11,260
(Just messing with him)
You still don't get it?

859
00:45:11,280 --> 00:45:12,160
Nope.

860
00:45:12,260 --> 00:45:13,120
(What's Bai trying to say?)

861
00:45:13,120 --> 00:45:15,160
You might need to make it more obvious.

862
00:45:16,260 --> 00:45:17,400
(How much clearer can I be?)

863
00:45:17,400 --> 00:45:18,520
I can't tell!

864
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:21,000
I've already found my guy,

865
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:23,080
but he won't give me a signal!

866
00:45:23,580 --> 00:45:25,180
(Pretending to be the boss)

867
00:45:30,160 --> 00:45:31,040
Bing, you're out!

868
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:32,840
Bing, you're out!

869
00:45:32,840 --> 00:45:34,220
(Quickly facing the right way)

870
00:45:34,380 --> 00:45:36,380
Bing, you're out!

871
00:45:38,900 --> 00:45:40,300
(Keeping an eye on Bai)

872
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:42,000
Just stretching my legs.

873
00:45:44,180 --> 00:45:47,140
(No way you
can miss all these corn hints)

874
00:45:47,180 --> 00:45:49,740
(What's that supposed to mean?)

875
00:45:49,740 --> 00:45:51,100
(No clue)

876
00:45:53,400 --> 00:45:54,560
Wang Churan, you're out!

877
00:45:57,260 --> 00:45:58,900
(Teng figured it out?)

878
00:45:58,900 --> 00:46:00,740
(Caught that shocked face)

879
00:46:01,220 --> 00:46:02,740
(Got Mr. Huang's attention)

880
00:46:03,880 --> 00:46:04,880
Wang Churan, you're out!

881
00:46:05,540 --> 00:46:07,900
(Huang figured it out too?)

882
00:46:08,040 --> 00:46:08,680
Bye, Churan.

883
00:46:13,400 --> 00:46:15,240
A few more are claiming
to be confirmed wolves.

884
00:46:19,840 --> 00:46:20,520
Wang Churan, you're out!

885
00:46:21,520 --> 00:46:22,680
Churan's eliminated.

886
00:46:23,740 --> 00:46:26,580
(Target Wang Churan eliminated)

887
00:46:26,580 --> 00:46:28,820
(Panicking)

888
00:46:28,900 --> 00:46:30,620
(Is Teng the boss?)

889
00:46:32,300 --> 00:46:33,260
(Deliberately looks at Teng)

890
00:46:33,620 --> 00:46:34,940
(Is it you, Teng?)

891
00:46:36,800 --> 00:46:37,760
Everyone, close your eyes.

892
00:46:39,960 --> 00:46:40,560
Boss,

893
00:46:40,560 --> 00:46:42,800
pick your next target to kill.

894
00:46:44,380 --> 00:46:45,980
(This villager's days are numbered)

895
00:46:49,260 --> 00:46:51,420
(Guessed it with his eyes closed)

896
00:46:51,460 --> 00:46:53,140
(In perfect sync)

897
00:46:54,200 --> 00:46:56,280
Three, two, one. Open your eyes.

898
00:46:58,540 --> 00:47:02,500
(Game continues)

899
00:47:06,080 --> 00:47:06,640
Stop shelling corn.

900
00:47:06,940 --> 00:47:10,380
(Here comes the act)

901
00:47:10,420 --> 00:47:13,060
(Don't try that on me)

902
00:47:15,660 --> 00:47:17,660
(Oh, this little punk)

903
00:47:20,240 --> 00:47:21,800
Grabbing your boss' corn?

904
00:47:21,820 --> 00:47:23,300
(Nice acting)

905
00:47:23,380 --> 00:47:25,500
(Cocky)

906
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:28,080
Hu, your gun is fake,

907
00:47:28,080 --> 00:47:29,360
but these guys
will actually beat you up.

908
00:47:31,040 --> 00:47:32,320
By the end of this round,

909
00:47:32,320 --> 00:47:33,720
who knows who's really armed?

910
00:47:40,460 --> 00:47:42,100
(Don't steal my arrow)

911
00:47:44,100 --> 00:47:45,980
(Making a new arrow by hand)

912
00:47:48,840 --> 00:47:50,040
Wang Anyu, you're out!

913
00:47:50,820 --> 00:47:54,740
(Making it by hand)

914
00:47:54,740 --> 00:47:56,580
(Making sure everyone sees it)

915
00:47:59,940 --> 00:48:01,700
(Waiting for the boss' orders)

916
00:48:01,740 --> 00:48:04,660
(DIY arrow complete)

917
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:12,680
So

918
00:48:13,520 --> 00:48:14,880
tell me who to shoot.

919
00:48:14,880 --> 00:48:16,700
(Pretends to look
at Teng for a clear signal)

920
00:48:18,420 --> 00:48:20,580
(Shooting from his belly button)

921
00:48:22,620 --> 00:48:24,140
(Shoot already!)

922
00:48:25,780 --> 00:48:28,620
(Take him out!)

923
00:48:31,500 --> 00:48:33,300
(Hu still doesn't get it)

924
00:48:33,900 --> 00:48:35,080
(Let the great Teng tell you)

925
00:48:35,080 --> 00:48:36,000
Who?

926
00:48:37,740 --> 00:48:39,180
(No eye signals allowed)

927
00:48:39,220 --> 00:48:40,240
(Sees everything)

928
00:48:40,240 --> 00:48:41,160
Who?

929
00:48:43,420 --> 00:48:44,980
(Shoot the one up there)

930
00:48:47,160 --> 00:48:47,680
If I were you,

931
00:48:47,680 --> 00:48:48,760
I'd shoot him first!

932
00:48:49,020 --> 00:48:50,740
(Takes the chance to make it obvious)

933
00:48:50,780 --> 00:48:52,300
(Got it)

934
00:48:52,600 --> 00:48:53,400
Who should I shoot?

935
00:48:53,400 --> 00:48:54,060
(Putting on a show)

936
00:48:54,200 --> 00:48:55,660
(What an idiot. Even I figured it out)
Wang Anyu.

937
00:48:55,920 --> 00:48:56,720
Really? Wang Anyu?

938
00:48:56,720 --> 00:48:57,160
Wang Anyu.

939
00:48:57,160 --> 00:48:57,560
(Yep)

940
00:48:57,560 --> 00:48:58,200
Wang Anyu, you're out!

941
00:48:59,420 --> 00:48:59,940
(Destroying the arrow)

942
00:48:59,960 --> 00:49:00,480
Anyu's eliminated.

943
00:49:03,520 --> 00:49:04,040
Anyu's eliminated.

944
00:49:04,040 --> 00:49:04,700
(Seriously?)

945
00:49:06,940 --> 00:49:08,300
(He's a witness this round)

946
00:49:09,320 --> 00:49:10,400
Everyone, close your eyes.

947
00:49:10,400 --> 00:49:11,780
(One more innocent down and they win)

948
00:49:12,160 --> 00:49:13,920
Boss, open your eyes and pick

949
00:49:13,920 --> 00:49:14,560
your next target to kill.

950
00:49:16,460 --> 00:49:18,300
(New target: Jia Bing)

951
00:49:18,400 --> 00:49:18,920
Close your eyes.

952
00:49:19,480 --> 00:49:21,160
Three, two, one. Open your eyes.

953
00:49:22,820 --> 00:49:25,340
(Still making it by hand)

954
00:49:25,440 --> 00:49:26,200
Who are you going to kill, Teng?

955
00:49:27,000 --> 00:49:27,400
Who?

956
00:49:27,460 --> 00:49:29,780
(Mr. Huang's got his eyes on you)

957
00:49:30,340 --> 00:49:31,380
(Sorry, bro)

958
00:49:35,040 --> 00:49:35,640
Just say a name.

959
00:49:35,640 --> 00:49:36,680
Let's see if they die.

960
00:49:37,440 --> 00:49:38,720
Then kill Bai.

961
00:49:38,720 --> 00:49:39,460
Kill Bai?

962
00:49:39,460 --> 00:49:40,940
(Sorry, can't do that)

963
00:49:42,240 --> 00:49:43,540
(Making another arrow)
Do it! What are you waiting for?

964
00:49:45,080 --> 00:49:45,760
Fire!

965
00:49:47,120 --> 00:49:47,800
It's getting dark.

966
00:49:48,320 --> 00:49:49,000
Fire!

967
00:49:52,820 --> 00:49:54,500
(Arrow's ready)

968
00:49:56,380 --> 00:49:57,740
(Points at Wang Anyu, then Wang Churan)

969
00:49:59,440 --> 00:50:00,480
Hu, just shoot already!

970
00:50:03,420 --> 00:50:04,180
(The two wolves might be communicating)

971
00:50:04,200 --> 00:50:04,760
Fire!

972
00:50:05,920 --> 00:50:06,680
Bing, you're out!

973
00:50:07,960 --> 00:50:08,440
Bing's eliminated.

974
00:50:08,960 --> 00:50:10,760
(Target Jia Bing eliminated)
Boss and Killer, mission accomplished.

975
00:50:10,900 --> 00:50:13,580
(Successful hit)

976
00:50:14,060 --> 00:50:15,560
(What just happened?)

977
00:50:15,560 --> 00:50:16,600
Time to vote.

978
00:50:17,040 --> 00:50:18,000
Identify the boss.

979
00:50:18,740 --> 00:50:20,080
(The hunt begins)

980
00:50:20,080 --> 00:50:20,680
Teng.

981
00:50:20,680 --> 00:50:22,320
The officer with the reading glasses.

982
00:50:22,320 --> 00:50:23,040
Teng.

983
00:50:23,040 --> 00:50:23,920
The officer with the reading glasses.

984
00:50:25,660 --> 00:50:27,540
(Is it really Teng?)

985
00:50:27,880 --> 00:50:29,800
I was totally guessing
the first two rounds.

986
00:50:30,220 --> 00:50:31,600
(Oh?)

987
00:50:31,600 --> 00:50:31,960
No, seriously.

988
00:50:32,400 --> 00:50:33,400
I'm confused myself.

989
00:50:33,400 --> 00:50:35,000
I can't believe I made myself

990
00:50:35,000 --> 00:50:36,320
look so convincing.

991
00:50:36,320 --> 00:50:37,040
(Even he can't believe his accuracy)

992
00:50:37,040 --> 00:50:38,440
I got both rounds right.

993
00:50:38,620 --> 00:50:40,140
(Destroying the arrow)

994
00:50:40,360 --> 00:50:42,440
(Avoiding eye contact. Say something)
It's like he's actually listening to me.

995
00:50:43,320 --> 00:50:45,120
I think in the first two rounds,

996
00:50:45,120 --> 00:50:47,600
(Going on the offensive)
when everyone shouted those two names,

997
00:50:47,600 --> 00:50:49,640
who called them out

998
00:50:50,120 --> 00:50:50,960
first?

999
00:50:50,960 --> 00:50:51,840
I did.

1000
00:50:51,840 --> 00:50:53,200
Pretty early on, I think.

1001
00:50:53,640 --> 00:50:54,840
Wang Churan, you're out!

1002
00:50:55,480 --> 00:50:56,360
Who?

1003
00:50:59,780 --> 00:51:01,100
(Well, there you have it)

1004
00:51:02,560 --> 00:51:03,840
But the third time, I said Bai,

1005
00:51:04,280 --> 00:51:05,400
and Bing got eliminated.

1006
00:51:05,400 --> 00:51:07,200
I think Teng's playing on another level.

1007
00:51:07,800 --> 00:51:08,680
He said Bai.

1008
00:51:08,680 --> 00:51:09,120
Yeah.

1009
00:51:09,120 --> 00:51:11,720
He's got each eye
watching someone different.

1010
00:51:13,280 --> 00:51:14,800
He calls out one person,

1011
00:51:14,800 --> 00:51:15,920
but points at another.

1012
00:51:16,120 --> 00:51:17,880
When he was looking at Bai,

1013
00:51:17,880 --> 00:51:20,040
his eyes kept darting toward Bing.

1014
00:51:20,040 --> 00:51:22,200
What am I, old man Shen
from the mailroom?

1015
00:51:22,640 --> 00:51:23,800
That's how he killed them.

1016
00:51:24,120 --> 00:51:24,720
I think...

1017
00:51:24,720 --> 00:51:26,000
His eyes were talking to us,

1018
00:51:26,000 --> 00:51:27,000
but only his left eye.

1019
00:51:27,000 --> 00:51:28,120
(Can't even get a word in)
But his right eye...

1020
00:51:28,120 --> 00:51:30,080
His right eye was watching Bing.

1021
00:51:30,080 --> 00:51:30,520
You know?

1022
00:51:30,880 --> 00:51:32,760
(Why are you cracking up?)
Hu kept watching his eyes.

1023
00:51:32,760 --> 00:51:33,520
Shotgun.

1024
00:51:33,520 --> 00:51:34,680
I'm a shotgun.

1025
00:51:37,280 --> 00:51:38,760
His eyes can talk.

1026
00:51:39,560 --> 00:51:40,840
His eyes don't just talk.

1027
00:51:40,840 --> 00:51:42,200
They can do the splits!

1028
00:51:44,360 --> 00:51:45,880
Chengcheng, look into my eyes.

1029
00:51:46,400 --> 00:51:47,440
What's my gaze saying?

1030
00:51:49,740 --> 00:51:51,820
(Probably not TV-friendly)

1031
00:51:52,240 --> 00:51:53,320
So dirty!

1032
00:51:53,320 --> 00:51:54,880
Seriously, that's filthy!

1033
00:51:55,280 --> 00:51:56,440
Those insults were brutal.

1034
00:51:56,880 --> 00:51:57,640
I gave myself away.

1035
00:51:59,580 --> 00:52:00,960
(Thinking)

1036
00:52:00,960 --> 00:52:03,200
I think it's Chengcheng this round.

1037
00:52:04,580 --> 00:52:05,820
(Me?)

1038
00:52:05,900 --> 00:52:07,820
(Oh?)

1039
00:52:08,300 --> 00:52:09,900
(Trying not to laugh)

1040
00:52:10,040 --> 00:52:11,080
(Poker face on)
Because in the last round,

1041
00:52:11,080 --> 00:52:12,640
I kept gesturing at you,

1042
00:52:13,040 --> 00:52:13,920
but he wouldn't shoot.

1043
00:52:13,920 --> 00:52:15,320
He kept looking behind me.

1044
00:52:15,320 --> 00:52:16,600
Then he suddenly killed Bing.

1045
00:52:16,960 --> 00:52:17,520
Don't you think

1046
00:52:17,520 --> 00:52:18,600
Chengcheng's pretty suspicious?

1047
00:52:19,100 --> 00:52:20,460
(Buying it)

1048
00:52:20,500 --> 00:52:22,540
(Secretly thrilled.gif)

1049
00:52:22,640 --> 00:52:24,200
Why was I leaning so far back?

1050
00:52:24,560 --> 00:52:25,320
Remember when Hu

1051
00:52:25,320 --> 00:52:26,880
walked behind me?

1052
00:52:27,560 --> 00:52:28,840
We were all shelling corn,

1053
00:52:28,840 --> 00:52:29,720
but Teng was the only one...

1054
00:52:34,000 --> 00:52:34,920
who suddenly did this.

1055
00:52:35,400 --> 00:52:36,640
(Noticed him leaning back repeatedly)
By the end of this round,

1056
00:52:36,640 --> 00:52:38,040
who knows who's really armed?

1057
00:52:41,400 --> 00:52:43,200
If I really were his boss,

1058
00:52:43,200 --> 00:52:45,280
would I make such an obvious move?

1059
00:52:47,880 --> 00:52:49,240
I was wondering that too.

1060
00:52:49,560 --> 00:52:50,680
(Adding fuel to the fire)
But now that I think about it,

1061
00:52:50,680 --> 00:52:52,000
I remember Hu

1062
00:52:52,000 --> 00:52:52,720
really did

1063
00:52:53,040 --> 00:52:54,960
look toward his boss for a target,

1064
00:52:55,480 --> 00:52:57,880
and he kept looking this way.

1065
00:52:57,880 --> 00:52:59,280
At first, I thought it was Anyu.

1066
00:53:00,160 --> 00:53:01,600
Let's think back

1067
00:53:01,600 --> 00:53:02,760
to when I got eliminated last round.

1068
00:53:02,760 --> 00:53:03,840
You can't talk.

1069
00:53:03,840 --> 00:53:04,680
You can only vote.

1070
00:53:06,260 --> 00:53:07,940
(We're in good hands with Mr. Huang)

1071
00:53:09,420 --> 00:53:10,140
(You won't even let me talk?)

1072
00:53:10,140 --> 00:53:11,180
(My razor-sharp brain)

1073
00:53:11,180 --> 00:53:12,340
(Has already figured it all out)

1074
00:53:12,720 --> 00:53:13,880
Just think about one thing.

1075
00:53:14,520 --> 00:53:16,120
I got the first two targets right.

1076
00:53:16,600 --> 00:53:17,960
(Thinking about it. Both were right)
Wang Churan, you're out!

1077
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:18,440
Who?

1078
00:53:18,440 --> 00:53:19,200
Wang Anyu.

1079
00:53:21,600 --> 00:53:22,600
And after thinking it over,

1080
00:53:22,600 --> 00:53:24,640
Huang Jingyu will vote you out
without hesitation.

1081
00:53:27,000 --> 00:53:27,920
Can we vote now?

1082
00:53:28,320 --> 00:53:28,920
No!

1083
00:53:28,920 --> 00:53:30,720
(Panicking)
Hold on. One second.

1084
00:53:30,720 --> 00:53:31,680
Three seconds. Five seconds.

1085
00:53:32,600 --> 00:53:33,480
An hour!

1086
00:53:33,480 --> 00:53:34,120
Only you and I...

1087
00:53:35,360 --> 00:53:36,160
Have any sense.

1088
00:53:36,160 --> 00:53:37,240
Yeah. Who are we voting for?

1089
00:53:37,240 --> 00:53:38,040
It's not that we're the only smart ones.

1090
00:53:38,040 --> 00:53:39,000
It's definitely one of those two.

1091
00:53:39,360 --> 00:53:40,520
I'm starting to suspect Teng.

1092
00:53:41,040 --> 00:53:42,880
If you called out those first two,

1093
00:53:42,880 --> 00:53:43,400
that's way too accurate.

1094
00:53:43,400 --> 00:53:43,800
Exactly.

1095
00:53:44,560 --> 00:53:45,240
Churan can't hold it in anymore.

1096
00:53:48,280 --> 00:53:50,240
I just think it's too accurate.

1097
00:53:52,400 --> 00:53:53,600
Neither of you

1098
00:53:54,400 --> 00:53:55,280
is actually

