Throwing me under the bus.

1146
00:55:35,600 --> 00:55:37,000
I knew I was done.

1147
00:55:37,620 --> 00:55:40,340
(Sorry, my bad)

1148
00:55:42,400 --> 00:55:43,400
Vote Chengcheng out.

1149
