Taking people out is so satisfying.

1206
00:57:32,480 --> 00:57:34,120
I wanna try the version with a hit list.

1207
00:57:34,120 --> 00:57:35,840
The gun version isn't that fun.

1208
00:57:35,840 --> 00:57:37,520
I think the gun version's pretty fun.

1209
00:57:37,520 --> 00:57:40,160
