1253
00:59:38,060 --> 00:59:40,140
(Getting up super awkwardly)

1254
00:59:43,200 --> 00:59:43,720
Not me.

1255
00:59:43,720 --> 00:59:44,520
You got it in my mouth.

1256
00:59:45,360 --> 00:59:46,080
You got it in my mouth.

1257
00:59:46,100 --> 00:59:47,700
